WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:28.320
Episode 21

01:46.570 --> 01:47.910
Miss.

01:47.930 --> 01:49.780
Commandant Yu is waiting for you.

01:50.380 --> 01:52.520
Aman, you go wait for me at home.

01:52.540 --> 01:53.900
Sure.

02:39.020 --> 02:42.410
Zhao Yu from the North Affiliate.

02:42.490 --> 02:43.370
You go ahead.

02:43.370 --> 02:44.720
Go to Tianxiang House in Ling'an.

02:44.740 --> 02:46.530
That's our stronghold.

02:46.980 --> 02:49.140
Senior Du, what about you?

02:49.140 --> 02:50.280
If I'm not dead,

02:50.300 --> 02:51.810
I'll meet you at the HQ.

02:51.980 --> 02:53.340
Go.

03:00.930 --> 03:02.290
(Du'er.)

03:02.370 --> 03:04.180
(Oh, no. I have to leave.)

03:04.180 --> 03:05.690
It's not me.

03:15.460 --> 03:17.500
Chief, do you believe it now?

03:17.530 --> 03:18.620
Jiang Si has connected

03:18.620 --> 03:19.980
with the Nightingale.

03:20.620 --> 03:22.230
You said there was no evidence

03:22.250 --> 03:23.510
so we couldn't hurt her.

03:23.530 --> 03:24.810
Then suddenly, you said

03:24.810 --> 03:25.750
she was not the Saintess

03:25.770 --> 03:27.400
and canceled the investigation.

03:27.420 --> 03:29.160
Now the evidence is clear.

03:29.180 --> 03:31.290
Are you going to pretend not to see it?

03:37.810 --> 03:39.530
I didn't expect that letter

03:40.090 --> 03:42.060
to fall into your hands.

03:42.650 --> 03:44.900
Commandant Yu is so lucky

03:45.090 --> 03:47.430
to have a girl like you
in love with him.

03:48.930 --> 03:50.900
Chief, here.

04:04.580 --> 04:06.730
You two really are in sync,

04:07.100 --> 04:09.340
a match made in heaven.

04:09.930 --> 04:11.290
What a pity.

04:11.540 --> 04:14.900
He is holding a bow aimed at you.

04:19.450 --> 04:21.260
(How ironic.)

04:21.300 --> 04:23.470
(I didn't expect
to meet you again so soon, )

04:23.490 --> 04:25.530
(yet you're pointing the arrow at me.)

04:55.130 --> 04:56.490
Let me.

04:57.200 --> 04:58.420
Now, I'll give you the answer.

04:58.420 --> 05:00.410
- No.
- What do you mean?

05:07.050 --> 05:09.620
You asked me before if I could kill her
at the right time.

05:09.620 --> 05:11.130
The answer is no.

05:11.130 --> 05:12.130
But she's the Saintess.

05:12.130 --> 05:13.530
No!

05:32.000 --> 05:34.860
(Tianxiang House)

05:34.880 --> 05:35.930
Go back to Capital Security

05:35.930 --> 05:36.890
and bring our men here.

05:36.910 --> 05:38.270
Yes.

07:11.180 --> 07:12.870
You're not Zhao Yu.

07:12.890 --> 07:14.470
I don't know what you're saying.

07:14.490 --> 07:16.780
Let's be honest.

07:16.860 --> 07:18.760
I'm the owner of this gambling den.

07:18.780 --> 07:20.140
My last name is Du.

07:20.340 --> 07:22.140
Now, who are you?

07:23.890 --> 07:25.180
As expected of Du'er,

07:25.180 --> 07:26.400
Leader of the Nightingale.

07:26.420 --> 07:28.470
You must have

07:28.490 --> 07:30.460
a different understanding of honesty.

07:32.100 --> 07:33.580
Few people who know my secret identity

07:33.580 --> 07:34.940
are still alive.

07:35.780 --> 07:37.610
Who exactly are you?

07:37.930 --> 07:40.200
I'm Jiang Si
from Earl Dongping's family.

07:40.220 --> 07:41.760
I'm not your enemy.

07:41.780 --> 07:43.790
Where did you get the Nightingale Token?

07:43.810 --> 07:45.700
Why do you know our secret?

07:46.010 --> 07:47.720
That Nightingale Token I have

07:47.740 --> 07:49.230
belongs to Sang Qi.

07:49.250 --> 07:51.280
The Token is proof of our members.

07:51.300 --> 07:52.650
It'd never be given to outsiders.

07:52.660 --> 07:53.670
Why do you

07:53.690 --> 07:54.930
have his token?

07:54.930 --> 07:57.580
Because I can enter
Capital Security's prison.

07:58.190 --> 08:00.200
You're so close to Commandant Yu.

08:00.220 --> 08:02.230
How would you betray Capital Security?

08:02.250 --> 08:04.020
Do you think I'm stupid?

08:06.540 --> 08:08.170
Let go.

08:09.370 --> 08:10.350
Senior Du.

08:10.370 --> 08:11.450
When I'm teaching her,

08:11.450 --> 08:12.740
could you not intervene?

08:12.740 --> 08:14.580
Then stop hitting her palm.

08:14.660 --> 08:15.890
Look at her hands.

08:15.890 --> 08:17.180
I'm doing this for her sake.

08:17.200 --> 08:18.020
Being strict with her

08:18.020 --> 08:20.030
will help her learn faster
and remember better.

08:20.050 --> 08:21.940
The materials for fragrances
have to be precise,

08:21.940 --> 08:23.460
or the effect will be completely off.

08:23.460 --> 08:24.680
She's just starting to learn.

08:24.700 --> 08:26.590
The stricter you are,
the less she'll learn.

08:26.590 --> 08:27.390
The Grand Elder

08:27.410 --> 08:28.740
taught us like this, right?

08:28.740 --> 08:30.300
Have you forgotten?

08:31.940 --> 08:33.420
Seniors,

08:33.460 --> 08:34.680
it's all my fault.

08:34.700 --> 08:35.870
I'll work harder

08:35.890 --> 08:37.370
and keep going.

08:38.940 --> 08:40.020
Just protect her.

08:40.030 --> 08:42.320
Next time,
you take the punishment for her.

08:42.340 --> 08:44.010
Fine. Hit me.

08:47.370 --> 08:48.720
(What should I do?)

08:48.740 --> 08:51.660
(I have to make him stop.)

09:07.410 --> 09:09.350
Because I can rescue Sang Qi

09:09.370 --> 09:10.250
without a fight.

09:10.250 --> 09:11.270
Why?

09:11.290 --> 09:12.650
I have my reasons.

09:12.670 --> 09:13.360
Just promise me

09:13.380 --> 09:15.560
that you'll stop the Nightingale
from doing anything.

09:15.580 --> 09:16.720
If I fail,

09:16.740 --> 09:18.610
you can make your plans.

11:22.010 --> 11:23.150
Yu Qi,

11:23.170 --> 11:24.800
if you don't surrender,

11:24.820 --> 11:26.850
I'll kill Jiang Si.

11:41.130 --> 11:42.390
Go through the back door.

11:42.410 --> 11:43.320
What do you mean?

11:43.340 --> 11:45.060
If you want to live, leave now.

11:55.700 --> 11:56.990
Or it'll be too late.

11:57.010 --> 11:58.820
Remember to wait
for Sang Qi at the temple

11:58.820 --> 12:00.220
outside the West Gate.

12:02.890 --> 12:04.250
Chief!

12:09.220 --> 12:10.580
Where did they go?

12:11.290 --> 12:12.650
They ran.

12:12.940 --> 12:14.300
Chief.

12:14.890 --> 12:16.730
Miss Jiang, are you hurt?

12:16.860 --> 12:18.150
- No.
- Go chase.

12:18.170 --> 12:19.530
Yes.

12:25.170 --> 12:26.530
I'm fine.

12:49.820 --> 12:51.700
This is the Nightingale's mark.

12:53.340 --> 12:54.770
The officers are here.

12:58.190 --> 12:59.060
Don't run.

12:59.060 --> 13:00.300
- Don't move.
- Don't move.

13:00.300 --> 13:01.660
Stop!

13:02.040 --> 13:03.640
You, squat down.

13:04.140 --> 13:04.690
My Lord...

13:04.690 --> 13:05.830
- Don't move.
- Squat down.

13:05.840 --> 13:07.540
Don't move.

13:07.540 --> 13:11.480
(Zhou Yi, Vice Minister of Rites)

13:16.100 --> 13:17.460
Explain it.

13:17.980 --> 13:20.060
Why did you go there tonight?

13:22.700 --> 13:24.420
Du'er intercepted my letter.

13:24.580 --> 13:25.580
I didn't expect him

13:25.600 --> 13:26.770
to be the one who showed up.

13:26.770 --> 13:28.660
Who did you plan to meet?

13:31.530 --> 13:33.010
Was it Zhen Heng?

13:35.940 --> 13:38.370
- No.
- There's another man?

13:40.010 --> 13:41.590
It's none of your business.

13:47.740 --> 13:50.340
This concerns the Nightingale.

13:50.460 --> 13:52.620
Capital Security has the responsibility

13:52.620 --> 13:54.300
to investigate.

13:56.170 --> 13:57.530
Alright.

13:57.740 --> 13:59.540
Then I'll tell you.

14:00.100 --> 14:01.560
You're familiar

14:01.580 --> 14:03.250
with the man I was meeting,

14:03.650 --> 14:05.150
but tonight,

14:05.170 --> 14:07.640
he was standing far away,
with a bow drawn at me.

14:20.100 --> 14:21.580
It wasn't me.

14:22.530 --> 14:23.970
It was Long Dan.

14:26.490 --> 14:28.560
You saw me with Du'er.

14:28.580 --> 14:30.160
You suspect me, don't you?

14:31.770 --> 14:33.230
Thankfully, Du'er acted quickly,

14:33.250 --> 14:34.700
or you might've

14:36.890 --> 14:38.010
shot me

14:38.010 --> 14:38.890
to death.

14:38.890 --> 14:40.250
Impossible.

14:41.460 --> 14:42.860
I could never do anything

14:42.860 --> 14:44.370
to harm you.

14:44.370 --> 14:45.730
Is that so?

14:46.490 --> 14:47.580
Then why did you send

14:47.580 --> 14:49.270
the Nightingale Token to me?

15:02.820 --> 15:05.130
I admit it.

15:07.010 --> 15:09.060
I was testing you.

15:16.820 --> 15:19.060
I don't know why,

15:19.130 --> 15:20.540
but

15:21.220 --> 15:22.060
if I really were

15:22.060 --> 15:23.820
the Saintess of Nanwu,

15:24.980 --> 15:26.370
what would you do?

15:29.860 --> 15:31.340
In my heart,

15:32.100 --> 15:33.220
you'll always be

15:33.220 --> 15:34.770
Miss Si from Earl Dongping's family.

15:34.770 --> 15:35.750
You'd never do anything

15:35.750 --> 15:37.660
to harm Dazhou.

15:37.940 --> 15:39.750
Whether or not you're the Saintess

15:39.770 --> 15:41.220
doesn't matter.

15:46.490 --> 15:48.300
If I start

15:49.650 --> 15:51.820
working with Nanwu one day,

15:55.700 --> 15:57.220
what will you do?

16:03.820 --> 16:06.300
I will protect Dazhou,

16:15.290 --> 16:17.420
and I'll protect you.

16:34.120 --> 16:37.640
(Capital Security Office)

16:55.130 --> 16:56.490
Commandant Yu.

16:56.930 --> 16:58.390
His Majesty issued an edict.

16:58.410 --> 16:59.630
The Mid-Autumn Hunt

16:59.650 --> 17:01.460
will be held at Mount Cuiluo.

17:02.450 --> 17:05.080
Officials above the 7th Rank
must attend.

17:05.100 --> 17:06.810
The Mid-Autumn Hunt?

17:06.890 --> 17:07.910
Yes.

17:07.930 --> 17:09.020
Many officials

17:09.020 --> 17:10.600
are hoping to use this chance

17:10.620 --> 17:13.010
to make an impression
in front of His Majesty.

17:26.160 --> 17:28.800
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

17:28.820 --> 17:30.180
Well...

17:30.580 --> 17:32.770
Qiao, you still need

17:33.020 --> 17:34.380
to meet

17:34.620 --> 17:36.520
Mr. Xiao.

17:36.540 --> 17:37.730
Your lineal mother and I

17:37.730 --> 17:39.080
will go with you.

17:39.100 --> 17:40.260
I'll also sit

17:40.260 --> 17:42.570
in a nearby side hall.

17:42.730 --> 17:44.080
Also,

17:44.100 --> 17:44.970
your mother

17:44.970 --> 17:46.210
can see this as well.

17:46.210 --> 17:47.570
Master Anmou,

17:47.650 --> 17:48.820
can you really bear this?

17:48.820 --> 17:50.060
Yes, Father.

17:50.060 --> 17:51.210
Please think of a way.

17:51.210 --> 17:52.570
Father,

17:53.930 --> 17:56.330
did I do something to upset you?

18:00.300 --> 18:01.840
It's too late.

18:01.860 --> 18:02.820
It's too late!

18:02.820 --> 18:04.670
Everything's too late.

18:04.690 --> 18:06.240
The Xiao family likes you.

18:06.260 --> 18:07.390
They wanted to meet you.

18:07.410 --> 18:09.170
Your lineal mother has agreed

18:09.170 --> 18:10.110
without asking me.

18:10.130 --> 18:11.240
She even stamped

18:11.260 --> 18:12.390
the reply letter

18:12.410 --> 18:13.710
with our family seal.

18:13.730 --> 18:15.370
Now, what can we do?

18:15.370 --> 18:16.780
But you are Qiao's father.

18:16.780 --> 18:18.060
If you strongly oppose it,

18:18.060 --> 18:19.870
they won't be able to force it.

18:21.970 --> 18:23.330
Father,

18:24.730 --> 18:26.140
please help me.

18:33.060 --> 18:35.020
Father, think of something.

18:35.020 --> 18:35.970
Please help Qiao.

18:35.970 --> 18:37.710
That's Lingbei Military Commissioner.

18:37.730 --> 18:38.890
If I make enemies everywhere,

18:38.890 --> 18:40.550
will I even keep my position after this?

18:40.570 --> 18:41.580
If it were that simple,

18:41.580 --> 18:43.630
I would have replied long ago.

18:43.650 --> 18:45.690
That's it. We'll see after the meeting.

18:54.580 --> 18:56.010
Qiao...

18:58.340 --> 18:59.700
Qiao...

19:23.260 --> 19:24.620
Ma'am,

19:26.620 --> 19:28.280
any news from the Xiaoxiang Chamber?

19:28.300 --> 19:29.800
Master Anmou has agreed,

19:29.820 --> 19:31.660
so they have no choice.

19:31.860 --> 19:34.480
However, Miss Qiao has been melancholy,

19:34.500 --> 19:35.890
staying in her room.

19:35.890 --> 19:37.810
I wonder what she's thinking.

19:38.020 --> 19:39.260
I heard from the kitchen

19:39.260 --> 19:40.650
that the meals sent to her

19:40.650 --> 19:42.730
haven't been touched much.

19:43.890 --> 19:45.730
She's just young and ignorant.

19:45.730 --> 19:47.910
It's a good family.

19:47.930 --> 19:49.710
She's just a concubine's daughter.

19:49.730 --> 19:50.580
What kind of family

19:50.580 --> 19:51.930
does she want?

19:51.930 --> 19:53.280
Come on.

19:53.300 --> 19:55.520
Whose life isn't like this?

19:55.540 --> 19:57.040
Find someone to keep an eye on her.

19:57.060 --> 19:58.860
Let the kitchen prepare
something delicious,

19:58.860 --> 20:00.420
so she doesn't lose weight.

20:00.500 --> 20:01.390
Yes.

20:01.410 --> 20:03.660
Ma'am, you're so thoughtful.

20:09.100 --> 20:10.460
Wait.

20:12.370 --> 20:14.100
I have to be cautious.

20:14.260 --> 20:15.860
Go call someone for me.

20:19.170 --> 20:21.600
How are you in your husband's family?

20:21.620 --> 20:22.620
Don't worry, Mother.

20:22.620 --> 20:24.340
My husband treats me very well.

20:25.650 --> 20:28.110
You've grown up after marriage.

20:28.130 --> 20:30.060
You're more mature and sensible.

20:30.060 --> 20:31.130
Pei has always been

20:31.130 --> 20:33.600
close to me.

20:33.620 --> 20:35.970
She always called me Mother.

20:35.970 --> 20:37.820
How obedient and sweet.

20:37.820 --> 20:38.710
Yes.

20:38.730 --> 20:41.190
Ms. Jiang Pei listens to you the most.

20:41.210 --> 20:42.300
Now that you're married,

20:42.300 --> 20:43.500
I suddenly can't see you,

20:43.500 --> 20:45.700
but I'm still thinking about you.

20:46.020 --> 20:49.570
In the past, I was ignorant.

20:49.650 --> 20:51.700
Thank you for your care.

20:51.970 --> 20:53.410
Now that you're married,

20:53.410 --> 20:55.180
I'm at ease.

20:55.500 --> 20:57.910
But I'm still worried

20:57.930 --> 20:59.190
about your sister's

20:59.210 --> 21:01.080
marriage.

21:01.100 --> 21:03.810
She's at the age to be married.

21:03.860 --> 21:04.890
She can't stay

21:04.890 --> 21:07.010
at home forever.

21:07.540 --> 21:09.060
Mr. Xiao

21:09.060 --> 21:10.900
is really good.

21:10.930 --> 21:12.730
You should persuade her.

21:14.930 --> 21:15.770
Mrs. Jiang Qiao,

21:15.770 --> 21:18.040
please don't mind me
speaking out of turn.

21:18.060 --> 21:20.860
Ms. Xiao's words are a bit harsh,

21:20.860 --> 21:23.100
but it's for your good.

21:23.300 --> 21:24.690
Like this time, when she asked you

21:24.690 --> 21:26.570
to persuade Miss Qiao,

21:26.620 --> 21:29.040
it was for the harmony of the family.

21:29.060 --> 21:30.450
So, why don't you

21:30.450 --> 21:31.950
reconsider?

21:31.970 --> 21:33.530
Alright, Mrs. Li.

21:33.780 --> 21:35.140
Please stop here.

21:39.620 --> 21:42.970
(When did Pei start mingling
with Ms. Xiao again?)

22:06.060 --> 22:07.540
You should be outside

22:07.540 --> 22:09.380
and bask in the sun like this.

22:09.450 --> 22:10.670
That way,

22:10.690 --> 22:12.770
you won't feel so gloomy.

22:14.580 --> 22:16.520
Actually, sometimes,

22:16.540 --> 22:17.760
once you figure things out,

22:17.780 --> 22:19.140
it'll be over.

22:27.730 --> 22:29.150
I'm a little tired.

22:29.170 --> 22:30.800
I'll go back to take a nap.

22:49.130 --> 22:50.390
Did you call me over

22:50.410 --> 22:52.140
just for this?

22:52.370 --> 22:53.730
What else?

23:06.410 --> 23:08.460
This box has a mechanism.

23:11.260 --> 23:12.620
I guessed it.

23:20.130 --> 23:21.660
Can you open it?

23:22.970 --> 23:24.620
Of course.

23:36.500 --> 23:37.970
Contracts.

23:39.450 --> 23:42.000
They're signed with Manager Du
from the gambling den.

23:42.020 --> 23:43.430
These people

23:43.450 --> 23:45.190
owe huge gambling debts.

23:45.210 --> 23:47.060
It also says
that if they help the Nightingale

23:47.060 --> 23:48.910
complete a certain task,

23:48.930 --> 23:51.180
they can offset their debts.

23:53.620 --> 23:55.810
The Vice Minister of Rites.

23:55.930 --> 23:57.040
Alright.

23:57.060 --> 23:59.040
Once I catch them,

23:59.060 --> 24:01.460
I'll interrogate them thoroughly.

24:01.500 --> 24:02.150
Find a reason

24:02.150 --> 24:03.350
unrelated to the Nightingale.

24:03.370 --> 24:04.210
Got it.

24:04.210 --> 24:06.220
We don't want to alert the enemy.

24:19.890 --> 24:22.870
Three quarters after the Wu hour;
the Mid-Autumn Hunt.

24:22.890 --> 24:25.940
Nanwu thrives; Jingming falls.

24:26.060 --> 24:28.280
Dazhou forbids learning
the Nanwu language,

24:28.300 --> 24:29.860
but you can recognize it?

24:31.300 --> 24:34.140
Looks like you know it too.

24:38.860 --> 24:40.450
Could it be that the Nightingale

24:40.450 --> 24:44.420
plans to act during the Mid-Autumn Hunt?

24:44.820 --> 24:47.430
(Emperor Jingming is supposed
to die this year.)

24:47.450 --> 24:49.660
(But wasn't it a sudden illness?)

24:49.730 --> 24:51.380
(Could his death)

24:51.540 --> 24:53.330
(be related to the Nightingale?)

24:53.890 --> 24:55.250
What did you say?

24:56.450 --> 24:57.500
I said if they plan to act

24:57.500 --> 24:59.340
during the Mid-Autumn Hunt,

24:59.340 --> 25:01.460
we must be cautious.

25:01.890 --> 25:04.390
What does "Three quarters
after the Wu hour" mean?

25:04.410 --> 25:05.800
Is it about time?

25:05.820 --> 25:07.660
Three quarters after the Wu hour.

25:08.060 --> 25:10.010
Why at this time?

25:11.820 --> 25:13.040
It's already the Wu hour.

25:13.060 --> 25:14.870
Why hasn't anyone brought lunch?

25:14.890 --> 25:16.080
This punishment

25:16.100 --> 25:18.420
will wear you out, Ma'am.

25:18.580 --> 25:19.670
Besides,

25:19.690 --> 25:21.570
today is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

25:27.170 --> 25:28.080
This...

25:28.100 --> 25:29.890
Why has the sky gone dark?

25:29.890 --> 25:32.480
Solar eclipse?

25:32.500 --> 25:34.420
This is an omen of a great disaster.

25:34.440 --> 25:37.280
(The ladies got up and said...)

25:44.580 --> 25:45.970
Why is the bell ringing?

25:45.970 --> 25:47.910
Ma'am, Emperor Jingming has passed away.

25:47.930 --> 25:49.860
This is to announce
the national mourning.

25:49.880 --> 25:50.730
What?

25:50.730 --> 25:51.700
His Majesty passed away

25:51.720 --> 25:53.940
when the solar eclipse happened.

25:54.210 --> 25:55.710
I heard that when the sky darkened,

25:55.730 --> 25:57.280
they couldn't even light the candles.

25:57.300 --> 25:58.940
How could this happen?

26:02.730 --> 26:04.620
Solar eclipse.

26:05.210 --> 26:09.050
Solar eclipse will happen
three quarters after the Wu hour.

26:09.300 --> 26:11.860
How did you know about that?

26:15.100 --> 26:16.280
I'm the Saintess.

26:16.300 --> 26:17.970
I can foresee the future.

26:18.170 --> 26:19.320
Is that strange?

26:19.340 --> 26:20.700
No, no.

26:21.020 --> 26:22.320
It seems

26:22.340 --> 26:23.340
the Nightingale plans

26:23.340 --> 26:24.430
to take this chance

26:24.450 --> 26:26.010
to kill Emperor Jingming.

26:27.650 --> 26:29.910
Will you go to the Mid-Autumn Hunt?

26:29.930 --> 26:31.290
I must go.

26:33.620 --> 26:35.010
Would you help me?

27:02.920 --> 27:05.840
(To)

27:18.720 --> 27:21.920
(Respectfully, Jiang Qiao)

27:41.760 --> 27:46.520
(Sealed by Jiang Qiao)

27:46.520 --> 27:50.040
(Court, Capital Security)

27:54.410 --> 27:55.940
Hurry to organize the testimonies

27:55.960 --> 27:57.600
from the interrogation last night.

27:57.620 --> 27:58.950
Yes, My Lord.

27:58.970 --> 28:00.910
You've worked for a day and a night.

28:00.930 --> 28:02.460
Please rest now.

28:02.780 --> 28:04.140
Go on.

28:24.930 --> 28:26.490
Thank you, Commandant Yu.

28:26.820 --> 28:28.570
Any progress?

28:29.650 --> 28:31.940
Just some ordinary gamblers.

28:33.210 --> 28:35.110
They'll be fined,
locked up for a few days,

28:35.130 --> 28:36.490
and then released.

28:36.620 --> 28:38.080
But according to them,

28:38.100 --> 28:39.900
this gambling den

28:40.130 --> 28:41.670
has been operating for years,

28:41.690 --> 28:43.620
and we've never caught wind of it.

28:44.730 --> 28:46.530
Fortunately,

28:46.650 --> 28:48.110
you acted swiftly

28:48.130 --> 28:50.950
and shut down this disastrous den.

28:50.970 --> 28:53.290
Mr. Zhen, you flatter me.

28:53.780 --> 28:55.340
With your compliment,

28:55.340 --> 28:57.420
I must help you.

28:57.890 --> 28:59.250
How about this?

28:59.690 --> 29:02.390
Issue an arrest warrant,

29:02.410 --> 29:04.100
and I'll interrogate Zhou Yi,

29:04.100 --> 29:06.050
Vice Minister of Rites.

29:09.170 --> 29:10.670
Vice Minister of Rites?

29:10.690 --> 29:12.050
Yes.

29:13.540 --> 29:14.800
No need for that.

29:14.820 --> 29:16.080
Why?

29:16.100 --> 29:17.870
He's among these gamblers.

29:17.890 --> 29:19.810
What a coincidence.

29:20.930 --> 29:22.330
Miss Si.

29:26.060 --> 29:27.420
Mr. Zhen.

29:27.730 --> 29:29.330
Miss Si is also here.

29:52.620 --> 29:54.770
Director of the Ministry of Revenue.

29:57.730 --> 30:00.310
Director of Exam Office,
the Ministry of Personnel.

30:03.340 --> 30:05.400
Councillor of the Ministry of Personnel.

30:05.420 --> 30:07.310
Vice Director of Natural Resources.

30:09.260 --> 30:11.190
I thought the officials were honest,

30:11.210 --> 30:13.430
but I didn't expect such a gambling den

30:13.450 --> 30:15.370
(Contract)
to entangle so many officials

30:15.370 --> 30:18.210
leaking state secrets
over and over again.

30:18.210 --> 30:19.190
Yes.

30:19.210 --> 30:20.320
Mr. Zhen,

30:20.340 --> 30:21.800
this gambling den

30:21.820 --> 30:23.860
might be connected to the Nightingale.

30:24.300 --> 30:25.660
What?

30:42.930 --> 30:44.290
Mother,

30:45.130 --> 30:46.490
I'm sorry.

30:48.260 --> 30:50.050
I'm not a filial daughter.

30:53.370 --> 30:54.730
I'm leaving now.

31:14.780 --> 31:16.250
Qiao.

31:19.500 --> 31:21.940
When I talked to you during the day,

31:21.970 --> 31:23.900
I sensed something was off,

31:23.930 --> 31:25.670
so I kept an eye on you.

31:25.690 --> 31:27.100
Are you planning to run away?

31:27.100 --> 31:28.370
Yes, I'm leaving.

31:28.370 --> 31:30.010
Where will you go?

31:30.930 --> 31:32.110
Anywhere is fine.

31:32.130 --> 31:33.970
Just because of this marriage?

31:35.690 --> 31:37.190
The rest of my life

31:37.210 --> 31:38.870
is controlled anyway,

31:38.890 --> 31:40.620
so I'd rather leave.

31:41.020 --> 31:42.300
I won't be Miss Qiao anymore.

31:42.300 --> 31:43.700
I'll be Jiang Qiao.

31:43.890 --> 31:45.520
Whether my life is good or not

31:45.540 --> 31:47.350
will be under my control.

31:47.370 --> 31:49.600
But you've never left home.

31:49.620 --> 31:50.890
If you leave here

31:50.890 --> 31:52.300
and no longer be Miss Qiao,

31:52.300 --> 31:53.540
how will you live alone outside?

31:53.540 --> 31:56.010
Do you know how dangerous
the world is out there?

31:59.730 --> 32:01.730
Are you worried about me,

32:01.930 --> 32:03.410
or are you worried that after I leave,

32:03.410 --> 32:05.760
you won't be able to explain it
to Ms. Xiao?

32:06.100 --> 32:07.760
What does she have to do with this?

32:07.780 --> 32:09.840
I saw Mrs. Li

32:09.860 --> 32:11.330
sending you back.

32:12.410 --> 32:13.770
What's going on?

32:13.970 --> 32:15.570
What happened?

32:19.930 --> 32:22.220
Is Miss Qiao about to leave?

32:25.020 --> 32:26.300
Tell me.

32:26.300 --> 32:28.150
What's going on

32:28.170 --> 32:30.860
in the middle of the night?

32:36.620 --> 32:38.110
My Lady,

32:38.130 --> 32:39.710
the servants on night watch

32:39.730 --> 32:41.000
heard some noise

32:41.020 --> 32:43.110
from Xiaoxiang Chamber on patrol.

32:43.130 --> 32:44.480
I was worried,

32:44.500 --> 32:46.390
so I took a few people to check.

32:46.410 --> 32:48.010
To my surprise,

32:48.410 --> 32:51.810
Miss Qiao was trying
to run away from home.

32:52.210 --> 32:53.560
What?

32:53.580 --> 32:55.620
Are you sure?

32:55.620 --> 32:57.420
I wouldn't dare speak recklessly.

33:01.650 --> 33:02.690
At that time, Miss Qiao

33:02.690 --> 33:04.320
was carrying her luggage,

33:04.340 --> 33:05.600
and on the table in her room,

33:05.620 --> 33:08.380
there was a farewell letter.

33:24.120 --> 33:25.580
(I tried to make my parents proud.)

33:25.580 --> 33:27.920
(I'm so thankful
that my parents raised me.)

33:30.930 --> 33:32.520
Take a look.

33:32.540 --> 33:34.430
This is your daughter.

33:34.450 --> 33:35.940
Your daughter.

33:45.930 --> 33:47.390
Do you really want to leave?

33:47.410 --> 33:49.010
You want to leave this home?

33:49.540 --> 33:50.430
Master Anmou,

33:50.450 --> 33:51.890
Qiao must have been confused

33:51.890 --> 33:53.040
because of the marriage.

33:53.060 --> 33:55.040
How could she really leave home?

33:55.060 --> 33:56.000
Qiao, hurry.

33:56.010 --> 33:57.730
Apologize to Grandmother
and Master Anmou.

33:57.730 --> 33:59.090
Qiao...

33:59.130 --> 34:00.400
Yes.

34:00.420 --> 34:01.750
Sorry for being unfilial.

34:01.770 --> 34:03.250
You...

34:04.020 --> 34:06.650
What about your father,
mother, and siblings?

34:06.650 --> 34:08.310
Are you leaving them behind?

34:08.330 --> 34:10.540
This family no longer wants me here.

34:10.940 --> 34:12.920
Rather than marrying some man,

34:12.940 --> 34:14.630
I'd rather leave and be carefree.

34:14.650 --> 34:17.830
But this marriage
hasn't been decided yet.

34:17.850 --> 34:20.920
If you're really unwilling,

34:20.940 --> 34:21.980
just say it.

34:21.980 --> 34:23.790
We can always find a way to solve it.

34:23.810 --> 34:27.410
Grandmother, what else can I say?

34:27.900 --> 34:29.500
My will is nothing

34:29.520 --> 34:30.690
compared to a piece of paper

34:30.690 --> 34:32.620
with the family seal.

34:33.690 --> 34:35.620
Alright, I accept it.

34:35.690 --> 34:37.520
Thank you for this.

34:37.540 --> 34:38.600
Mother.

34:38.620 --> 34:41.110
Take it inside
to make the bed for Mother.

34:41.130 --> 34:42.480
Fu, go help.

34:42.500 --> 34:44.100
No need. Let her go.

34:44.100 --> 34:45.850
You can brew the tea.

34:46.100 --> 34:47.580
Here, Mother.

34:50.520 --> 34:53.620
That family seal represents our honesty.

34:53.900 --> 34:54.810
We only agreed

34:54.810 --> 34:56.110
for you to meet him.

34:56.130 --> 34:57.500
We didn't agree on anything else.

34:57.500 --> 34:58.780
"I only need to meet him."

34:58.800 --> 34:59.980
"I only need to get engaged."

34:59.980 --> 35:01.610
"I only have to marry him."

35:01.630 --> 35:02.850
What exactly can be considered

35:02.850 --> 35:04.250
a big deal then?

35:04.620 --> 35:05.540
I don't want

35:05.540 --> 35:06.690
to live my life aimlessly

35:06.690 --> 35:08.150
and without a purpose.

35:08.250 --> 35:10.310
The girls in our family

35:10.330 --> 35:12.540
are all sharp-tongued.

35:12.540 --> 35:14.110
Where are her manners?

35:14.130 --> 35:15.460
Look, look.

35:15.460 --> 35:17.890
Look at what you've all done.

35:20.690 --> 35:23.180
I don't want to be troubled by this.

35:23.810 --> 35:26.710
Anmou, this is your family matter.

35:26.730 --> 35:29.060
You deal with it yourself.

35:33.810 --> 35:35.220
Yes, Mother.

35:42.650 --> 35:43.670
Lock her up

35:43.690 --> 35:45.040
so she can think about it.

35:45.060 --> 35:46.690
Master Anmou, please spare Qiao.

35:46.690 --> 35:47.710
And you.

35:47.730 --> 35:49.270
You failed to educate her.

35:49.290 --> 35:51.220
Go back and copy the book ten times,

35:51.380 --> 35:52.850
so you can learn how other families

35:52.870 --> 35:55.220
raise their children.

36:03.540 --> 36:05.930
Some people have broken

36:06.210 --> 36:09.140
our family rules.

36:13.200 --> 36:16.200
(Prison)

36:44.500 --> 36:45.860
Mr. Zhou.

36:49.020 --> 36:50.450
Mr. Zhou.

36:53.100 --> 36:54.620
Who is calling me?

36:56.330 --> 36:57.690
Please come with me.

37:03.280 --> 37:04.170
After you.

37:04.170 --> 37:05.380
- Mr. Zhou.
- Mr. Zhou.

37:05.380 --> 37:06.850
What do we do if you leave, Mr. Zhou?

37:06.860 --> 37:07.710
Mr. Zhou.

37:07.710 --> 37:08.860
You must save us!

37:08.880 --> 37:09.750
Mr. Zhou.

37:09.770 --> 37:11.210
It was you who invited us here.

37:11.210 --> 37:12.050
Mr. Zhou.

37:12.060 --> 37:13.270
Mr. Zhou!

37:13.290 --> 37:14.560
Don't leave!

37:14.580 --> 37:15.940
Mother,

37:17.620 --> 37:19.110
don't you blame me?

37:19.130 --> 37:20.580
Blame you for what?

37:20.810 --> 37:22.980
For being willful and causing trouble,

37:23.330 --> 37:25.120
and for running away from home.

37:25.210 --> 37:27.080
If you leave,

37:27.100 --> 37:28.170
does that mean

37:28.170 --> 37:30.000
everything the family has done for you

37:30.020 --> 37:32.330
is completely denied?

37:32.540 --> 37:35.220
Your father would naturally feel hurt,

37:36.060 --> 37:37.830
but I know

37:37.850 --> 37:39.480
that you care

37:39.500 --> 37:40.960
for this family

37:40.980 --> 37:43.220
and me.

37:43.460 --> 37:45.310
I've never forgotten

37:45.330 --> 37:46.420
how nice Father, you,

37:46.420 --> 37:48.220
and everyone else

37:48.500 --> 37:50.110
in this family treated me.

37:50.130 --> 37:52.980
I don't want
to leave all of this behind.

37:55.020 --> 37:57.250
I just really don't know

37:57.250 --> 37:58.230
what to do.

37:58.250 --> 37:59.600
I know.

37:59.620 --> 38:01.700
I know everything you've said.

38:03.210 --> 38:05.410
I'm sorry.

38:05.580 --> 38:07.880
I know how careful,

38:07.900 --> 38:09.020
considerate, and decent

38:09.020 --> 38:11.210
you are

38:11.210 --> 38:13.330
in this family.

38:13.770 --> 38:15.540
But now...

38:15.850 --> 38:17.210
It's all my fault.

38:18.130 --> 38:19.440
It's alright.

38:19.460 --> 38:21.150
Really.

38:21.170 --> 38:22.100
Why would I care

38:22.100 --> 38:23.700
what they say?

38:24.060 --> 38:25.230
In this family,

38:25.250 --> 38:27.360
only you and Pei are my daughters.

38:27.380 --> 38:28.920
My greatest wish

38:28.940 --> 38:31.250
is for you both to live well.

38:33.060 --> 38:34.930
I'll copy the book with you.

38:35.690 --> 38:36.560
Qiao,

38:36.580 --> 38:38.500
no need for this.

39:12.080 --> 39:16.440
(Embarrass her parents...)

39:22.460 --> 39:24.850
Mother, Qiao.

39:28.550 --> 39:29.410
Pei.

39:29.420 --> 39:31.290
Mother, Qiao.

39:32.940 --> 39:34.280
I just went to Guangju Restaurant

39:34.290 --> 39:35.560
and bought some snacks.

39:35.580 --> 39:36.420
They're freshly baked

39:36.420 --> 39:37.670
and still warm.

39:37.690 --> 39:38.540
Aren't these

39:38.540 --> 39:40.450
Qiao's favorites?

39:41.690 --> 39:42.890
It smells so good.

39:42.910 --> 39:44.020
Try some, Qiao.

39:44.020 --> 39:45.380
I'm not hungry.

39:47.980 --> 39:49.230
Then I'll make some tea.

39:49.250 --> 39:50.610
Alright.

39:53.980 --> 39:55.340
No need.

39:55.380 --> 39:56.840
I'm not thirsty either.

40:01.810 --> 40:03.620
Look at us.

40:03.620 --> 40:05.440
We're finally together.

40:05.460 --> 40:07.290
Let's sit down and have a drink.

40:08.130 --> 40:09.650
I think someone is thinking

40:09.650 --> 40:11.360
about Ms. Xiao

40:11.380 --> 40:12.810
and doesn't want to talk with us.

40:12.830 --> 40:15.150
Qiao, what are you saying?

40:15.170 --> 40:17.450
I kindly brought some snacks,

40:17.770 --> 40:20.440
and yet Qiao wronged me like this.

40:20.460 --> 40:21.820
That's not fair.

40:23.020 --> 40:24.620
You know

40:24.620 --> 40:26.410
what you're up to.

40:26.460 --> 40:27.750
I really didn't expect it.

40:27.770 --> 40:29.360
You're married now.

40:29.380 --> 40:31.730
Why are you still flattering Ms. Xiao?

40:31.810 --> 40:34.220
What good could she possibly bring you?

40:34.460 --> 40:35.890
Ms. Xiao?

40:36.730 --> 40:39.480
Pei, what did you do?

40:39.500 --> 40:41.270
Why would I flatter Ms. Xiao?

40:41.290 --> 40:42.600
That's nonsense.

40:42.620 --> 40:43.960
Mother,

40:43.980 --> 40:45.210
I saw

40:45.210 --> 40:47.100
Mrs. Li send her back.

40:47.230 --> 40:48.580
I don't know what Pei and Ms. Xiao

40:48.580 --> 40:50.330
talked about in private,

40:51.290 --> 40:53.710
but she later urged me to meet Mr. Xiao.

40:53.730 --> 40:55.930
Isn't that Ms. Xiao's idea?

40:56.100 --> 40:58.000
Last night, I just left the house,

40:58.020 --> 40:59.830
and Pei immediately followed me.

40:59.850 --> 41:01.100
Mrs. Li just happened to show up

41:01.100 --> 41:03.520
and caught me right in the act.

41:03.540 --> 41:04.750
I think

41:04.770 --> 41:06.100
Pei must've passed the message

41:06.100 --> 41:07.580
to Ms. Xiao.

41:08.020 --> 41:09.880
Pei, you're being foolish.

41:09.900 --> 41:11.830
Why are you still mingling with her?

41:11.850 --> 41:14.090
Have you forgotten
the lessons of the past?

41:15.770 --> 41:17.700
Is this how you see me?

41:19.210 --> 41:21.410
Haven't you done similar things before?

41:22.170 --> 41:23.850
I just didn't expect

41:25.290 --> 41:26.880
that nature is so hard to change.

41:26.900 --> 41:29.020
Qiao is your sister.

41:29.020 --> 41:31.630
How could you help outsiders
to go against her?

41:31.650 --> 41:33.620
Since you dislike me,

41:35.810 --> 41:37.270
I'll leave.

41:37.290 --> 41:38.830
The one who should leave is not her

41:38.850 --> 41:40.210
but me.

41:41.540 --> 41:43.880
They fought in Xiaoxiang Chamber,

41:43.900 --> 41:45.420
and Ms. Pei packed her things

41:45.420 --> 41:46.570
and left the house.

41:46.590 --> 41:49.180
She must've returned
to her husband's house early.

41:50.500 --> 41:51.500
It's raining on the way

41:51.500 --> 41:53.150
from Ling'an to Lingbei.

41:53.170 --> 41:54.540
The letter to the Xiao family

41:54.540 --> 41:56.700
might be delayed by a few days.

41:57.540 --> 41:59.500
A delay is good.

41:59.620 --> 42:01.290
It'll give Jiang Qiao time

42:01.290 --> 42:02.890
to think things through.

42:03.380 --> 42:05.540
Good things take time.

42:06.420 --> 42:08.170
What's wrong

42:08.170 --> 42:09.400
with our family?

42:09.420 --> 42:10.650
None of our girls

42:10.650 --> 42:12.220
can spare me some worries.

42:16.900 --> 42:18.980
Sorry for last night.

42:19.580 --> 42:20.600
Commandant Yu and I

42:20.620 --> 42:22.580
prepared some food and wine

42:22.900 --> 42:24.450
to apologize.

42:24.810 --> 42:26.400
Thank you.

42:26.420 --> 42:27.780
Cheers.

42:33.730 --> 42:35.370
This is

42:36.170 --> 42:38.370
really troublesome.

42:39.380 --> 42:40.480
Mr. Zhen,

42:40.500 --> 42:42.500
thank you so much. Here.

42:42.540 --> 42:44.450
You suffered the most.

42:46.620 --> 42:47.980
Mr. Zhou,

42:48.380 --> 42:50.890
take a look. Is this your name?

42:50.890 --> 42:52.130
(Signed by: Zhou Yi)

42:52.130 --> 42:52.970
That's right.

42:52.990 --> 42:56.920
(The End of Episode 21)

42:57.410 --> 42:59.140
♪ From place to place ♪

42:59.140 --> 43:04.080
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:04.450 --> 43:06.830
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:06.830 --> 43:11.060
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:11.770 --> 43:14.170
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:14.190 --> 43:17.850
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:17.870 --> 43:21.290
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:21.440 --> 43:26.960
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:27.780 --> 43:31.460
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:31.460 --> 43:35.540
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:35.780 --> 43:37.520
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:37.540 --> 43:42.240
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:42.240 --> 43:45.810
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:45.830 --> 43:50.060
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:50.080 --> 43:51.860
♪ Time glows ♪

43:51.860 --> 43:56.400
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:56.420 --> 44:01.220
♪ And stars ♪

44:05.450 --> 44:07.980
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:08.000 --> 44:11.620
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:11.640 --> 44:15.070
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:15.090 --> 44:19.710
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:19.710 --> 44:23.400
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:23.420 --> 44:27.510
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:27.620 --> 44:29.440
♪ Time glows ♪

44:29.440 --> 44:33.990
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:34.010 --> 44:37.710
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:37.730 --> 44:41.890
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:42.070 --> 44:43.830
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:43.830 --> 44:48.350
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:48.350 --> 44:51.990
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:52.010 --> 44:57.680
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:59.370 --> 45:01.300
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

45:01.300 --> 45:08.800
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
